            rows.map(r => `<div class="src-row"><span class="src-inv">${r.inv}</span><span class="src-host" tabindex="0" aria-label="Detalhes ${r.inv}">ⓘ</span></div>`).join('');
        box.querySelectorAll('.src-host').forEach((h, i) => {
            const on = () => { if (!h.querySelector('.src-tip')) h.appendChild(mk('span', 'src-tip', 'Código: ' + rows[i].code)); };
            const off = () => { const t = h.querySelector('.src-tip'); if (t) t.remove(); };
            h.addEventListener('mouseenter', on); h.addEventListener('mouseleave', off); h.addEventListener('focus', on); h.addEventListener('blur', off);
        });
    } else if (key === 'CtxCode') {
        box.innerHTML = `<div class="src-title">Clique com o botão direito na fatura desejada</div>` +
            rows.map(r => `<div class="src-row ctx-row"><span class="src-inv">${r.inv}</span><span class="muted">botão direito</span></div>`).join('');
        box.querySelectorAll('.ctx-row').forEach((row, i) => {
            row.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => {
                e.preventDefault();
                box.querySelectorAll('.ctx-menu').forEach(m => m.remove());
                const m = mk('div', 'ctx-menu', `<div class="ctx-item">Copiar</div><div class="ctx-item">Detalhes</div><div class="ctx-item ctx-code">Código: ${rows[i].code}</div>`);
                m.style.left = e.clientX + 'px'; m.style.top = e.clientY + 'px';
                box.appendChild(m);
                setTimeout(() => box.ownerDocument.addEventListener('click', () => m.remove(), { once: true }), 0);
            });
        });
    } else if (key === 'DblCode') {
        box.innerHTML = `<div class="src-title">Dê um duplo clique na fatura desejada</div>` +
            rows.map(r => `<div class="src-row dbl-row"><span class="src-inv">${r.inv}</span><span class="dbl-out muted">duplo clique</span></div>`).join('');
        box.querySelectorAll('.dbl-row').forEach((row, i) => {
            row.addEventListener('dblclick', () => { const o = row.querySelector('.dbl-out'); o.textContent = 'Código: ' + rows[i].code; o.classList.remove('muted'); });
        });
    } else {
        box.innerHTML = `<div class="src-title">Role a lista até o fim para carregar mais faturas</div><div class="scroll-box" tabindex="0"></div>`;
        const sb = box.querySelector('.scroll-box'); let loaded = 0, busy = false;
        const addRows = n => { rows.slice(loaded, loaded + n).forEach(r => sb.appendChild(mk('div', 'src-row', `<span class="src-inv">${r.inv}</span><span>Código: ${r.code}</span>`))); loaded = Math.min(rows.length, loaded + n); };
        addRows(4);
        sb.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            if (busy || loaded >= rows.length) return;
            if (sb.scrollTop + sb.clientHeight >= sb.scrollHeight - 6) {
                busy = true; const ld = mk('div', 'src-row muted', 'Carregando...'); sb.appendChild(ld);
                setTimeout(() => { ld.remove(); addRows(3); busy = false; }, 600);
            }
        });
    }
    return box;
}

/* =====================================================================
   CONSTRUÇÃO DO FORMULÁRIO
   ===================================================================== */
function newRecord() {
    state.draft = {}; state.step = 1; state.hp = false; state.rowStartTime = Date.now(); state.mouseMoves = 0; state.recordActive = true; state.view = 'form';
    setProgress(); scheduleInterruption();
    renderForm();
}

function clearError() { hide('form-error'); }
function showError(errs) {
    const msgs = Object.keys(errs).map(k => `${FDEF[k].label}: ${errs[k]}`);
    const e = $('form-error'); e.innerText = 'Erros de validação — ' + msgs.join(' | '); show('form-error');
}

function renderForm() {
    const f = curLevel().flags; clearError();
    const tok = ++state.renderToken;
    if (f.delay) {
        hide('screen-form'); show('screen-loading');
        setTimeout(() => { if (tok !== state.renderToken || state.phase !== 'work') return; buildDOM(); }, 400 + Math.random() * 900);
    } else buildDOM();
}

function mapId(key, flags, staticName) { const id = flags.dynId ? genId() : (staticName || key); state.idMap[key] = id; return id; }

function textHtml(key, id, flags, label, hint) {
    const d = FDEF[key], h = hint ? `<span class="hint">${hint}</span>` : '';
    return flags.customEls
        ? `<label class="label">${label}</label>${h}<div id="${id}" data-field="${key}" contenteditable="true" class="custom-input"></div>`
        : `<label for="${id}" class="label">${label}</label>${h}<input type="${d.type || 'text'}" id="${id}" name="${id}" class="input-base" autocomplete="off">`;
}

function createFieldEl(key, flags) {
    const d = FDEF[key], div = mk('div', d.wide ? 'fspan2' : '');
    if (d.kind === 'text') {
        div.innerHTML = textHtml(key, mapId(key, flags), flags, d.label);
    } else if (d.kind === 'srctext') {
        div.innerHTML = textHtml(key, mapId(key, flags), flags, d.label, 'Use o widget abaixo para descobrir o código da fatura');
        div.insertBefore(srcWidget(key), div.querySelector('input,.custom-input'));
    } else if (d.kind === 'radio') {
        const grp = mapId(key, flags, 'RoleGroup');
        if (flags.customEls) {
            div.innerHTML = `<label class="label">${d.label}</label><div class="custom-radio-group" id="${grp}">${MOCK.roles.map(r => `<div class="custom-radio" data-val="${r}">${r}</div>`).join('')}</div>`;
            div.querySelectorAll('.custom-radio').forEach(x => x.addEventListener('click', () => { div.querySelectorAll('.custom-radio').forEach(y => y.classList.remove('selected')); x.classList.add('selected'); }));
        } else {
            div.innerHTML = `<label class="label">${d.label}</label><div class="radio-group">${MOCK.roles.map((r, i) => `<label class="radio-label"><input type="radio" name="${grp}" id="${flags.dynId ? genId() : 'role_' + i}" value="${r}"> ${r}</label>`).join('')}</div>`;
        }
    } else if (d.kind === 'check') {
        const id = mapId(key, flags);
        if (flags.customEls) {
            div.innerHTML = `<label class="label">Core Skills</label><div class="custom-check" id="${id}"><div class="custom-check-box"></div> ${d.label}</div>`;
            div.querySelector('.custom-check').addEventListener('click', ev => ev.currentTarget.classList.toggle('selected'));
        } else {
            div.innerHTML = `<label class="label">Core Skills</label><label class="radio-label"><input type="checkbox" id="${id}" name="${id}"> ${d.label}</label>`;
        }
    } else if (d.kind === 'select') {
        const id = mapId(key, flags);
        if (flags.customEls) {
            div.innerHTML = `<label class="label">${d.label}</label><div class="custom-select" id="${id}"><div class="select-trigger">Select Department...</div><div class="select-options">${MOCK.deps.map(x => `<div class="select-item" data-val="${x}">${x}</div>`).join('')}</div></div>`;
            const tr = div.querySelector('.select-trigger'), op = div.querySelector('.select-options'), sel = div.querySelector('.custom-select');
            tr.addEventListener('click', () => op.classList.toggle('open'));
            div.querySelectorAll('.select-item').forEach(it => it.addEventListener('click', () => { tr.textContent = it.dataset.val; op.classList.remove('open'); sel.dataset.value = it.dataset.val; }));
        } else {
            div.innerHTML = `<label for="${id}" class="label">${d.label}</label><select id="${id}" name="${id}" class="input-base"><option value="">Select...</option>${MOCK.deps.map(x => `<option value="${x}">${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;
        }
    } else if (COMPKINDS.includes(d.kind)) {
        const id = mapId(key, flags);
        div.innerHTML = `<label class="label" for="${id}">${d.label}</label>${d.hint ? `<span class="hint">${d.hint}</span>` : ''}`;
        div.appendChild(compCtl(key, id));
    }
    return div;
}

function readField(key) {
    const d = FDEF[key], id = state.idMap[key], q = state.rootNode, f = curLevel().flags;
    if (!id || !q) return null;
    if (d.kind === 'radio') {
        if (f.customEls) { const g = q.querySelector('#' + id), s = g && g.querySelector('.selected'); return s ? s.dataset.val : ''; }
        const s = q.querySelector(`input[name="${id}"]:checked`); return s ? s.value : '';
    }
    const el = q.querySelector('#' + id); if (!el) return null;
    if (COMPKINDS.includes(d.kind)) return el.__get ? el.__get() : null;
    if (d.kind === 'check') return (f.customEls ? el.classList.contains('selected') : el.checked) ? 'Yes' : 'No';
    if (d.kind === 'select') return f.customEls ? (el.dataset.value || '') : el.value;
    return f.customEls ? el.textContent.trim() : el.value.trim();
}

function writeField(key, val) {
    const d = FDEF[key], id = state.idMap[key], q = state.rootNode, f = curLevel().flags;
    if (!id || !q || val == null || val === '') return;
    if (d.kind === 'radio') {
        if (f.customEls) { const g = q.querySelector('#' + id); if (g) g.querySelectorAll('.custom-radio').forEach(x => x.classList.toggle('selected', x.dataset.val === val)); }
        else { const r = q.querySelector(`input[name="${id}"][value="${val}"]`); if (r) r.checked = true; }
        return;
    }
    const el = q.querySelector('#' + id); if (!el) return;
    if (COMPKINDS.includes(d.kind)) { if (el.__set) el.__set(val); return; }
    if (d.kind === 'check') { if (f.customEls) el.classList.toggle('selected', val === 'Yes'); else el.checked = (val === 'Yes'); }
    else if (d.kind === 'select') { if (f.customEls) { el.dataset.value = val; el.querySelector('.select-trigger').textContent = val; } else el.value = val; }
    else { if (f.customEls) el.textContent = val; else el.value = val; }
}

function collectStep() {
    state.renderedKeys.forEach(k => { const v = readField(k); if (v !== null) state.draft[k] = v; });
    if (state.idMap.Website_HP && state.rootNode) {
        const el = state.rootNode.querySelector('#' + state.idMap.Website_HP);
        if (el && el.value.trim() !== '') state.hp = true;
    }
}

function buildDOM() {
    const L = curLevel(), flags = L.flags, queue = L.mode === 'queue';
    hide('screen-loading'); show('screen-form');
    if (queue) { show('toolbar'); if (flags.excel) show('btn-excel'); else hide('btn-excel'); } else hide('toolbar');
    ensureTable();

    const host = $('form-host'); host.innerHTML = ''; state.idMap = {}; state.iframeRef = null;
    const css = $('form-styles').innerHTML;
    let mount, qroot;

    if (flags.iframe) {
        const iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
        iframe.style.width = '100%'; iframe.style.border = 'none'; iframe.style.minHeight = '520px';
        host.appendChild(iframe);
        const doc = iframe.contentWindow.document;
        doc.open(); doc.write(`<html><head>${css}</head><body style="padding:10px 10px 160px;margin:0;background:#fff"></body></html>`); doc.close();
        doc.addEventListener('mousemove', () => { state.mouseMoves++; });
        state.iframeRef = iframe;
        if (flags.shadow) { const w = doc.createElement('div'); doc.body.appendChild(w); mount = w.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' }); mount.innerHTML = css; qroot = mount; }
        else { mount = doc.body; qroot = doc; }
    } else if (flags.shadow) {
        const w = document.createElement('div'); host.appendChild(w);
        mount = w.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' }); mount.innerHTML = css; qroot = mount;
    } else {
        mount = host; qroot = document;
        if (!$('injected-global')) { const st = document.createElement('style'); st.id = 'injected-global'; st.innerHTML = css.replace(/<style>|<\/style>/g, ''); document.head.appendChild(st); }
    }
    state.rootNode = qroot;

    const steps = stepsOf(flags);
    const layout = flags.wizard ? 'wizard' : flags.tabs ? 'tabs' : flags.accordion ? 'acc' : 'flat';
    let keys = activeFields(flags);
    if (layout === 'wizard') keys = keys.filter(k => FDEF[k].step === state.step);
    state.renderedKeys = keys;

    const hpEl = () => {
        const hp = mk('div'), hpId = mapId('Website_HP', flags);
        hp.innerHTML = `<label for="${hpId}">Website</label><input type="text" id="${hpId}" name="${hpId}" class="hp-field" value="" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">`;
        return hp;
    };

    const grid = mk('div', 'fgrid');

    if (layout === 'wizard') {
        const idx = steps.indexOf(state.step);
        const w = mk('div', 'fspan2', `<div class="wiz-label">ETAPA ${idx + 1} DE ${steps.length} · ${stepName(state.step, flags).toUpperCase()}</div><div class="wiz-bar"><div style="width:${((idx + 1) / steps.length) * 100}%"></div></div>`);
        grid.appendChild(w);
    }

    if (!queue && flags.extra) {
        const rec = state.dataset[state.row], bar = mk('div', 'invoice-box fspan2');
        if (flags.canvasOcr) bar.innerHTML = `<div><span class="cap">OCR EXTRACTION REQUIRED</span><canvas id="ocr-canvas" width="220" height="60" class="ocr-canvas"></canvas></div>`;
        else { const iid = flags.dynId ? genId() : 'invoice-display'; bar.innerHTML = `<div><span class="cap">Extract This ID:</span><span id="${iid}" class="invoice-text">${rec.InvoiceNumber}</span></div>`; }
        grid.appendChild(bar);
    }

    if (layout === 'tabs' || layout === 'acc') {
        const by = {}; keys.forEach(k => { (by[FDEF[k].step] = by[FDEF[k].step] || []).push(k); });
        const wrap = mk('div', 'fspan2');
        const head = mk('div', 'tab-head'); if (layout === 'tabs') { head.setAttribute('role', 'tablist'); wrap.appendChild(head); }
        const panels = [], btns = [];
        steps.forEach((s, i) => {
            const panel = mk('div', 'sec-panel' + (i === 0 ? '' : ' hidden')); panel.dataset.step = s;
            const pg = mk('div', 'fgrid');
            let els = (by[s] || []).map(k => createFieldEl(k, flags));
            if (flags.shuffle) els = shuffle(els);
            if (i === 0 && flags.honeypot) els.push(hpEl());
            els.forEach(e => pg.appendChild(e));
            panel.appendChild(pg); panels.push(panel);
            const btn = mk('button', layout === 'tabs' ? 'tab-btn' + (i === 0 ? ' active' : '') : 'acc-head' + (i === 0 ? ' open' : ''), stepName(s, flags));
            btn.type = 'button'; btn.dataset.step = s; btns.push(btn);
            if (layout === 'tabs') {
                btn.setAttribute('role', 'tab'); panel.setAttribute('role', 'tabpanel');
                btn.addEventListener('click', () => { btns.forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn)); panels.forEach(p => p.classList.toggle('hidden', p !== panel)); });
                head.appendChild(btn);
            } else {
                btn.addEventListener('click', () => { const open = panel.classList.toggle('hidden') === false; btn.classList.toggle('open', open); });
                wrap.appendChild(btn); wrap.appendChild(panel);
            }
        });
        if (layout === 'tabs') panels.forEach(p => wrap.appendChild(p));
        grid.appendChild(wrap);
    } else {
        let els = keys.map(k => createFieldEl(k, flags));
        if (flags.honeypot) els.push(hpEl());
        if (flags.shuffle) els = shuffle(els);
        els.forEach(e => grid.appendChild(e));
    }

    mount.appendChild(grid);
    if (flags.canvasOcr && !queue) { const c = mount.querySelector('#ocr-canvas'); if (c) drawInvoiceCanvas(c, state.dataset[state.row].InvoiceNumber); }

    keys.forEach(k => writeField(k, state.draft[k]));

    const last = !flags.wizard || state.step === steps[steps.length - 1];
    if (flags.svgSubmit && last) {
        const wrap = mk('div', 'fspan2');
        wrap.style.cssText = 'display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:0 4px';
        wrap.innerHTML = `<svg width="220" height="56" class="svg-btn" role="button" aria-label="Submit"><rect width="220" height="56" fill="#0b0b0c" rx="8"/><rect width="216" height="52" x="2" y="2" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2" rx="6" stroke-dasharray="4"/><text x="110" y="34" fill="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">SUBMIT (BOSS)</text></svg>`;
        wrap.querySelector('svg').addEventListener('click', ev => window.submitCurrentRow(ev));
        mount.appendChild(wrap);
    }

    if (flags.iframe && state.iframeRef) setTimeout(() => { try { state.iframeRef.style.height = state.iframeRef.contentWindow.document.body.scrollHeight + 20 + 'px'; } catch (e) { } }, 150);
    renderControls();
}

function renderControls() {
    const L = curLevel(), f = L.flags, queue = L.mode === 'queue';
    const wrap = $('native-submit-wrapper'); wrap.innerHTML = '';
    const steps = stepsOf(f), idx = steps.indexOf(state.step);
    const last = !f.wizard || idx === steps.length - 1;
    const mkb = (txt, cls, id, fn) => { const b = mk('button', cls, txt); b.id = id; b.type = 'button'; b.addEventListener('click', fn); wrap.appendChild(b); };
    if (queue) mkb('Limpar', 'btn btn-light', 'btn-clear', () => { state.draft = {}; state.step = 1; state.hp = false; renderForm(); log('form_cleared'); });
    if (f.wizard && idx > 0) mkb('← Voltar', 'btn btn-light', 'btn-back', () => prevStep());
    if (!last) mkb('Próximo →', 'btn btn-blue', 'btn-next', () => nextStep());
    else if (!f.svgSubmit) mkb(queue ? 'Enviar Registro' : 'Submit Record', 'btn', 'btn-submit', e => window.submitCurrentRow(e));
}

function drawInvoiceCanvas(canvas, text) {
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    ctx.fillStyle = '#f4f6f8'; ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i++) { ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(Math.random() * canvas.width, Math.random() * canvas.height); ctx.lineTo(Math.random() * canvas.width, Math.random() * canvas.height); ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(0,0,0,${Math.random() * .2})`; ctx.stroke(); }
    ctx.font = 'bold 26px Courier New'; ctx.fillStyle = '#25272b';
    let x = 20; for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) { ctx.fillText(text[i], x, 35 + (Math.random() * 8 - 4)); x += 18; }
}

/* =====================================================================
   VALIDAÇÃO, ETAPAS E ENVIO
   ===================================================================== */
function validateDraft(d, onlyStep) {
    const f = curLevel().flags, errs = {};
    activeFields(f).filter(k => !onlyStep || FDEF[k].step === onlyStep).forEach(k => {
        if (d[k] === undefined || d[k] === null || d[k] === '') errs[k] = 'campo obrigatório';
    });
    if (!errs.Email && d.Email && !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(d.Email)) errs.Email = 'e-mail inválido';
    if (!errs.CPF && d.CPF && !cpfValid(d.CPF)) errs.CPF = 'CPF inválido';
    if (!errs.Amount && d.Amount && !/^\d{1,3}(\.\d{3})*,\d{2}$|^\d+,\d{2}$/.test(d.Amount)) errs.Amount = 'formato inválido (use 1.234,56)';
    if (!errs.Date && d.Date) {
        const m = d.Date.match(/^(\d{2})\/(\d{2})\/(\d{4})$/);
        const dt = m && new Date(+m[3], +m[2] - 1, +m[1]);
        if (!m || dt.getDate() !== +m[1] || dt.getMonth() !== +m[2] - 1) errs.Date = 'data inválida (dd/mm/aaaa)';
    }
    return errs;
}

function nextStep() {
    if (state.phase !== 'work' || !ensureSession()) return;
    collectStep();
    const f = curLevel().flags;
    if (f.validate) { const errs = validateDraft(state.draft, state.step); if (Object.keys(errs).length) { state.validationErrors++; showError(errs); log('validation_fail', { errs }); return; } }
    const st = stepsOf(f), i = st.indexOf(state.step);
    state.step = st[Math.min(st.length - 1, i + 1)]; log('step_next', { step: state.step }); renderForm();
}
function prevStep() {
    collectStep();
    const st = stepsOf(curLevel().flags), i = st.indexOf(state.step);
    state.step = st[Math.max(0, i - 1)]; renderForm();
}

function antiBotCheck(e) {
    const L = curLevel();
    if ($('opt-webdriver').checked && navigator.webdriver) return 'navigator.webdriver detectado (automação via WebDriver).';
    if (e && e.isTrusted === false) return 'Evento sintético (isTrusted = false): clique disparado via JavaScript.';
    const dur = Date.now() - state.rowStartTime, min = L.minRowMs || 1000;
    if (dur < min) return `Velocidade desumana: registro preenchido em ${dur}ms (mínimo ${min}ms).`;
    if (state.mouseMoves < (L.minMouse || 3)) return `Trajetória de mouse insuficiente (${state.mouseMoves} eventos).`;
    return null;
}

window.submitCurrentRow = function (e) {
    if (state.isSubmitting || state.phase !== 'work') return;
    if (!ensureSession()) return;
    state.isSubmitting = true;
    const release = () => setTimeout(() => { state.isSubmitting = false; }, 100);
    const L = curLevel(), f = L.flags;

    if (f.antiBot && !$('opt-noantibot').checked) {
        const why = antiBotCheck(e);
        if (why) { state.isSubmitting = false; blockUser(why); return; }
    }

    collectStep();

    if (f.validate) {
        const errs = validateDraft(state.draft);
        if (Object.keys(errs).length) {
            state.validationErrors++; log('validation_fail', { errs });
            if (f.wizard) state.step = Math.min(...Object.keys(errs).map(k => FDEF[k].step));
            renderForm(); showError(errs); release(); return;
        }
    }

    if (L.mode === 'queue') queueSubmit(state.hp); else seqSubmit(state.hp);
    release();
};

function seqSubmit(hp) {
    const f = curLevel().flags, rec = state.dataset[state.row], fields = activeFields(f);
    let correct = 0;
    if (!hp) fields.forEach(k => { const v = state.draft[k]; if (v && norm(v) === norm(rec[k])) correct++; });
    state.results.push({ correct, total: fields.length });
    log('row_submit', { row: state.row, correct, total: fields.length, hp });
    state.row++;
    if (state.row < 5) newRecord(); else finishLevel();
}

function queueSubmit(hp) {
    const f = curLevel().flags, fields = activeFields(f);
    const email = norm(state.draft.Email);
    const matches = state.dataset.filter(r => norm(r.Email) === email);
    const rec = matches.find(r => r.valid && !r.processed);
    if (rec && !hp) {
        let c = 0; fields.forEach(k => { const v = state.draft[k]; if (v && norm(v) === norm(rec[k])) c++; });
        rec.processed = true; rec.fieldsOk = c;
        log('queue_ok', { invoice: rec.InvoiceNumber, correct: c, total: fields.length });
    } else {
        const why = hp ? 'honeypot preenchido' : matches.length ? (matches.some(m => m.valid) ? 'registro duplicado' : 'registro cancelado/inválido') : 'registro inexistente nos dados';
        state.unwanted.push({ email: state.draft.Email, why }); log('queue_unwanted', { email: state.draft.Email, why });
    }
    state.sent++; setProgress();
    showToast('Registro enviado com sucesso ✓', 2200);
    newRecord();
}

window.finishQueue = function () {
    if (state.phase !== 'work' || !ensureSession()) return;
    if (curLevel().flags.upload) {
        state.view = 'upload'; clearTimeout(state.intTimer); $('overlay-root').innerHTML = '';
        hide('screen-form'); hide('upload-error'); show('screen-upload'); log('upload_screen');
    } else finishLevel();
};

/* =====================================================================
   EXCEL: GERAÇÃO DA PLANILHA E CONCILIAÇÃO DO RELATÓRIO
   ===================================================================== */
window.downloadExcel = function () {
    if (state.phase !== 'work' || !ensureSession()) return;
    const f = curLevel().flags;
    state.downloads++; log('excel_download');
    let headers;
    if (f.split) headers = ['Fatura', 'CPF', 'Valor', 'Data', 'Status'];
    else {
        headers = ['Nome', 'Sobrenome', 'Email', 'Telefone', 'Empresa', 'Cargo', 'RPA', 'JavaScript', 'Departamento', 'Fatura'];
        if (f.fin) headers.push('CPF', 'Valor', 'Data');
        headers.push('Status');
    }
    const toRow = r => headers.map(h => r.raw[h]);
    const sheetOf = recs => {
        const ws = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([['RELATÓRIO DE CLIENTES - CONFIDENCIAL'], [], headers].concat(recs.map(toRow)));
        ws['!merges'] = [{ s: { r: 0, c: 0 }, e: { r: 0, c: headers.length - 1 } }];
        return ws;
    };
    if (typeof XLSX === 'undefined') {
        const csv = headers.join(';') + '\n' + state.dataset.map(r => toRow(r).join(';')).join('\n');
        const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv], { type: 'text/csv' })); a.download = 'clientes.csv'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove();
        showToast('Biblioteca XLSX indisponível (offline?): baixado em CSV.', 5000); return;
    }
    const wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();
    XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([['LEIAME'], ['Este arquivo contém dados de clientes.'], [f.twoSheets ? 'Os dados válidos estão nas abas iniciadas por "Dados".' : 'Os dados válidos estão na aba "Dados".'], ['Ignore abas de resumo.'], ['Gerado em', new Date().toISOString()]]), 'LEIAME');
    if (f.twoSheets) {
        const half = Math.ceil(state.dataset.length / 2);
        XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, sheetOf(state.dataset.slice(0, half)), 'Dados_A');
        XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, sheetOf(state.dataset.slice(half)), 'Dados_B');
        XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([['Resumo'], ['Total de linhas', state.dataset.length + 3], ['Ativos', Math.max(0, state.dataset.filter(r => r.valid).length - 2)]]), 'Resumo');
    } else XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, sheetOf(state.dataset), 'Dados');
    XLSX.writeFile(wb, f.twoSheets ? `clientes_${Date.now()}.xlsx` : 'clientes.xlsx');
};

window.onReportSelected = function (input) {
    const file = input.files && input.files[0]; if (!file) return;
    const err = m => { const e = $('upload-error'); e.innerText = m; show('upload-error'); };
    if (typeof XLSX === 'undefined') { err('Biblioteca XLSX indisponível.'); return; }
    if (curLevel().flags.session && !state.session.active) { ensureSession(); return; }
    const rd = new FileReader();
    rd.onload = ev => {
        try {
            const wb = XLSX.read(new Uint8Array(ev.target.result), { type: 'array' });
            const name = wb.SheetNames.find(n => /resultado/i.test(n)) || wb.SheetNames[0];
            const rows = XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json(wb.Sheets[name], { defval: '' });
            state.reportEval = compareReport(rows); log('report_evaluated', { ok: state.reportEval.ok, issues: state.reportEval.issues.length });
            finishLevel();
        } catch (e) { err('Não foi possível ler o arquivo: ' + e.message); }
    };
    rd.readAsArrayBuffer(file);
};

function compareReport(rows) {
    const map = new Map();
    rows.forEach(r => {
        const o = {}; Object.keys(r).forEach(k => { o[stripAcc(k).toLowerCase()] = r[k]; });
        if (o.fatura !== undefined) map.set(stripAcc(o.fatura), o);
    });
    const issues = []; let correct = 0;
    state.dataset.forEach(rec => {
        const got = map.get(stripAcc(rec.InvoiceNumber));
        const expSt = rec.valid ? 'PROCESSADO' : 'IGNORADO';
        if (!got) { issues.push(`${rec.InvoiceNumber}: linha ausente no relatório`); return; }
        if (stripAcc(got.status) !== expSt) { issues.push(`${rec.InvoiceNumber}: status "${got.status}" (esperado ${expSt})`); return; }
        if (!rec.valid && stripAcc(got.motivo) !== rec.reason) { issues.push(`${rec.InvoiceNumber}: motivo "${got.motivo}" (esperado ${rec.reason})`); return; }
        correct++;
    });
    const known = new Set(state.dataset.map(r => stripAcc(r.InvoiceNumber)));
    map.forEach((v, k) => { if (!known.has(k)) issues.push(`${k}: fatura inexistente na planilha`); });
    return { ok: issues.length === 0, total: state.dataset.length, correct, issues };
}

/* =====================================================================
   RESULTADO FINAL
   ===================================================================== */
function finishLevel() {
    stopAll(); state.phase = 'done';
    hideAllScreens(); ['ui-timer', 'ui-progress', 'ui-session'].forEach(hide);
    const L = curLevel(); let acc = 0, pass = false, details = '';
    const li = (ok, t) => `<div>${ok ? '✅' : '❌'} ${t}</div>`;

    if (L.mode === 'queue') {
        const valid = state.dataset.filter(r => r.valid), per = activeFields(L.flags).length;
        const totalF = valid.length * per, okF = valid.reduce((s, r) => s + r.fieldsOk, 0);
        const missing = valid.filter(r => !r.processed).length;
        acc = totalF ? (okF / totalF) * 100 : 0;
        pass = acc === 100 && missing === 0 && state.unwanted.length === 0 && (!L.flags.upload || (state.reportEval && state.reportEval.ok));
        details += li(missing === 0, `Registros válidos cadastrados: ${valid.length - missing}/${valid.length}`);
        details += li(state.unwanted.length === 0, `Submissões indevidas: ${state.unwanted.length}` + (state.unwanted.length ? ' (' + state.unwanted.map(u => `${u.email || '?'}: ${u.why}`).join('; ') + ')' : ''));
        details += `<div>ℹ️ Erros de validação: ${state.validationErrors} · Sessões expiradas: ${state.expirations} · Logins falhos: ${state.loginFails} · Pop-ups tratados: ${state.interrupts} · Downloads: ${state.downloads}</div>`;
        if (L.flags.upload) {
            const r = state.reportEval;
            details += li(r && r.ok, r ? `Relatório de conciliação: ${r.correct}/${r.total} linhas corretas` + (r.issues.length ? '<br><span style="font-size:12px">' + r.issues.slice(0, 8).join('<br>') + '</span>' : '') : 'Relatório não enviado');
        }
    } else {
        let c = 0, t = 0; state.results.forEach(r => { c += r.correct; t += r.total; });
        acc = t ? (c / t) * 100 : 0; pass = acc === 100;
    }

    $('res-accuracy').innerText = `${acc.toFixed(1)}%`;
    $('res-time').innerText = $('timer-val').innerText;
    $('res-details').innerHTML = details;
    const icon = $('result-icon');
    icon.className = 'icon-circle big ' + (pass ? 'ok' : 'bad');
    icon.textContent = pass ? '✓' : '✕';
    $('result-title').innerText = pass ? 'Flawless Victory!' : 'Bot Failure';
    show('screen-results'); log('finish', { acc, pass });
}

window.onload = () => {
    initApp();
    $('tbl-filter').addEventListener('input', e => { if (state.tbl) { state.tbl.filter = e.target.value; state.tbl.page = 0; drawTable(); } });
    $('tbl-prev').addEventListener('click', () => { if (state.tbl) { state.tbl.page = Math.max(0, state.tbl.page - 1); drawTable(); } });
    $('tbl-next').addEventListener('click', () => { if (state.tbl) { state.tbl.page++; drawTable(); } });
    $('data-table').addEventListener('click', e => {
        const th = e.target.closest('th'); if (!th || !state.tbl) return;
        const k = th.dataset.col; state.tbl.dir = state.tbl.sort === k ? -state.tbl.dir : 1; state.tbl.sort = k; drawTable();
    });
    selectLevel(1);
};
</script>
